{"id":"756c3fb270afadd7b50866063a62f484a683c430","url":"https://hub.baai.ac.cn/view/57711","title":"新版GPT Image 2.5已经能伪造GPT-6发布会了 - 智源社区","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":"量子位\n                  2026-09-05 06:50 分享","excerpt":"GPT-6发布会视频实为AI伪造，由新版生图模型GPT Image 2.5生成，主持人“赛博义父Tibo”系虚构角色。该模型尚未正式发布，但已有用户在ChatGPT中收到相关弹窗提示。版本号跳至2.5（非此前猜测的2.1），显示升级幅度显著。测试表明，其图像生成能力极强，可高度逼真地模拟官方发布会场景，包括人物、场景与细节，凸显多模态伪造技术的新突破，也引发对深度伪造内容传播风险的担忧。（150字）","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div id=\"js_content\"><h5 data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\">编辑部 发自 凹非寺</span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\">量子位 | 公众号 QbitAI</span></h5><p><span leaf=\"\">GPT-6发布会，主持人居然是赛博义父Tibo？</span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100434908\" data-ratio=\"0.5682281059063137\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/16793f7e4d9607c831eed63a3bf24bde1788562201824.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"982\" type=\"block\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/16793f7e4d9607c831eed63a3bf24bde1788562201824.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">其实这是新版生图模型</span><span leaf=\"\" data-pm-slice=\"1 1 [&quot;para&quot;,{&quot;tagName&quot;:&quot;p&quot;,&quot;attributes&quot;:{&quot;style&quot;:&quot;font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); font-variant-ligatures: normal; orphans: 2; widows: 2; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; font-family: Arial; text-align: left; letter-spacing: 1px !important; word-spacing: 1px !important; line-height: 2 !important; min-height: 1.5em !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; overflow-wrap: break-word !important; margin: 20px 16px !important;&quot;},&quot;namespaceURI&quot;:&quot;http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml&quot;}]\"><span textstyle=\"\">GPT Image 2.5</span><span textstyle=\"\">伪造的。</span></span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">虽然还没正式发布，但已经有人收到ChatGPT中新的弹窗提示。</span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/9192c26fc1632f5c4accd87bc73d9f881788562201825.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.5736698499317872\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"2932\" data-imgfileid=\"100434893\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/9192c26fc1632f5c4accd87bc73d9f881788562201825.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">与之前猜测叫GPT Image 2.1不同，版本号直接来到2.5，看来升级幅度不小。</span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-aistatus=\"1\" data-imgfileid=\"100434884\" data-ratio=\"0.14991023339317774\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4d7aa55b747f2b2f1962e024daeaeab41788562201825.webp\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1114\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/4d7aa55b747f2b2f1962e024daeaeab41788562201825.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">那么，<span textstyle=\"\">GPT Image 2.5</span>有多强？</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\">根据目传播的测试结果，大概是可以直接伪造GPT-6官方发布会以及奥特曼全员信的程度。。。</span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/5b2bd01eaae350e569d7c9ed929ee7341788562201825.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.0134680134680134\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1188\" data-imgfileid=\"100434887\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/5b2bd01eaae350e569d7c9ed929ee7341788562201825.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">生成一张奥特曼发推的截图，除了头像不对之外，文字也是毫无破绽。</span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/6528d0f3ba09990b9c1ac0f654dce2221788562201825.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.8998330550918197\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1198\" data-imgfileid=\"100434883\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/6528d0f3ba09990b9c1ac0f654dce2221788562201825.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">提示词：用手机拍摄一张写实风格的手写文章照片，文章是用铅笔写在8.5x11英寸的横格纸上的，字迹要像爱因斯坦的笔迹，内容是关于世界货币的历史。确保字迹有明显的爱因斯坦式变化。在右上角添加一点咖啡渍。</span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/afeb5a3199727365731179571ce747c71788562201825.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.2949183303085299\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1102\" data-imgfileid=\"100434896\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/afeb5a3199727365731179571ce747c71788562201825.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">那么爱因斯坦笔迹什么样呢，放一张照片对比一下。</span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/01e4040124ad39219240591af7edee941788562201825.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.6206896551724138\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"812\" type=\"block\" data-imgfileid=\"100434906\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/01e4040124ad39219240591af7edee941788562201825.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">在LMArena竞技场上，代号luna-lisa-alpha的匿名模型被猜测正是新版GPT Image，经过一段时间测试，已发现如下特点：</span></p><ul><li><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">生成速度超快</span></span></section></li><li><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">照片更加逼真</span></span></section></li><li><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">即使生成多张同一角色的图像，脸部也不易变形</span></span></section></li><li><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">图像中嵌入的文字也不易变形</span></span></section></li><li><section><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">改进了GPT Image 2的噪点问题</span></span></section></li></ul><p><span leaf=\"\">你看这树可真树啊，这房子可真房子啊，这羊可真羊啊，这景深可真深啊。</span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/feb9a6363fd0970aeb61a3a93414493e1788562201826.webp\" data-ratio=\"0.75\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1200\" data-imgfileid=\"100434891\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/feb9a6363fd0970aeb61a3a93414493e1788562201826.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">与GPT Image 2直接对比更直观。</span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/96d674053e515936c59a6ed02a3a02e21788562201826.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.207191780821918\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1168\" data-imgfileid=\"100434892\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/96d674053e515936c59a6ed02a3a02e21788562201826.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">ChatGPT网页版一度将生图功能提高到主目录第二位，仅次于“新聊天”（现在又隐藏了）。</span></p><section nodeleaf=\"\"><img loading=\"lazy\" data-src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7c7870b4aaaea8d58c1d0a1b44853a731788562201826.webp\" data-ratio=\"1.1214953271028036\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"1070\" data-imgfileid=\"100434885\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://simg.baai.ac.cn/hub-detail/7c7870b4aaaea8d58c1d0a1b44853a731788562201826.webp\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\"></section><p><span leaf=\"\">看来生图也将是GPT-6时代的一个主打功能。</span></p><p><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">参考链接：</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">[1]https://x.com/chetaslua/status/2095556181012128005?s=20</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">[2]https://x.com/choblin29/status/2095559067569967357</span></span><span leaf=\"\"><br></span><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">[3]https://x.com/btibor91/status/2095184112646844702?s=20</span></span></p><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\"><section><section><p><strong><span leaf=\"\">一键三连</span></strong><span><strong><span leaf=\"\">「点赞」「转发」「小心心」</span></strong></span></p><p><strong><span leaf=\"\">欢迎在评论区留下你的想法！</span></strong></p></section><section><svg viewBox=\"0 0 1 1\" style=\"float:left;line-height:0;width:0;vertical-align:top;\" /></section></section><section><p><span><span leaf=\"\">—&#160;</span><strong><span leaf=\"\">完</span></strong><span leaf=\"\">&#160;—</span></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span leaf=\"\">🌟 点亮星标 🌟</span></strong></p><section><strong><span leaf=\"\">科技前沿进展每日见</span></strong></section></section></section><section><span leaf=\"\"><mp-common-profile data-pluginname=\"mpprofile\" data-nickname=\"量子位\" data-alias=\"QbitAI\" data-from=\"0\" data-headimg=\"http://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/YicUhk5aAGtCEFSVW5ubo08Zfv1qB5iapricibTBdETkBNtolJxnSUib6UXhjWWz3aib8vETY00P2lKR1uG3qLHicSoWg/0?wx_fmt=png\" data-signature=\"追踪人工智能新趋势，关注科技行业新突破\" data-id=\"MzIzNjc1NzUzMw==\" data-is_biz_ban=\"0\" data-service_type=\"1\"></mp-common-profile></span></section></div></DIV>","content_text":"编辑部 发自 凹非寺量子位 | 公众号 QbitAIGPT-6发布会，主持人居然是赛博义父Tibo？其实这是新版生图模型GPT Image 2.5伪造的。虽然还没正式发布，但已经有人收到ChatGPT中新的弹窗提示。与之前猜测叫GPT Image 2.1不同，版本号直接来到2.5，看来升级幅度不小。那么，GPT Image 2.5有多强？根据目传播的测试结果，大概是可以直接伪造GPT-6官方发布会以及奥特曼全员信的程度。。。生成一张奥特曼发推的截图，除了头像不对之外，文字也是毫无破绽。提示词：用手机拍摄一张写实风格的手写文章照片，文章是用铅笔写在8.5x11英寸的横格纸上的，字迹要像爱因斯坦的笔迹，内容是关于世界货币的历史。确保字迹有明显的爱因斯坦式变化。在右上角添加一点咖啡渍。那么爱因斯坦笔迹什么样呢，放一张照片对比一下。在LMArena竞技场上，代号luna-lisa-alpha的匿名模型被猜测正是新版GPT Image，经过一段时间测试，已发现如下特点：生成速度超快照片更加逼真即使生成多张同一角色的图像，脸部也不易变形图像中嵌入的文字也不易变形改进了GPT Image 2的噪点问题你看这树可真树啊，这房子可真房子啊，这羊可真羊啊，这景深可真深啊。与GPT Image 2直接对比更直观。ChatGPT网页版一度将生图功能提高到主目录第二位，仅次于“新聊天”（现在又隐藏了）。看来生图也将是GPT-6时代的一个主打功能。参考链接：[1]https://x.com/chetaslua/status/2095556181012128005?s=20[2]https://x.com/choblin29/status/2095559067569967357[3]https://x.com/btibor91/status/2095184112646844702?s=20一键三连「点赞」「转发」「小心心」欢迎在评论区留下你的想法！— 完 —🌟 点亮星标 🌟科技前沿进展每日见","fetched_at":"2026-09-05T16:04:06.898Z","ok":true}